WEBVTT

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:06.290
<i>﻿Gunpla Battle World Tournament,
﻿last match of the first period.</i>

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:08.590
<i>﻿The legend is finally revived.</i>

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.530
<i>﻿The PPSE works team is here
﻿as the organizer's special entry,</i>

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.700
<i>﻿and their fighter is the third
﻿to inherit the title of...</i>

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>﻿the Meijin who was called
﻿the God of Gunpla building,</i>

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:23.110
<i>﻿Meijin Kawaguchi!</i>

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.340
﻿P-President Yuuki?

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:28.110
﻿China, do you know him?

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.050
﻿Y-Yes, I think so.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.690
﻿But he bowed out of the qualifiers.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.960
﻿Why is he at the World Tournament?

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:13.530
﻿The Kämpfer Amazing.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:17.060
﻿It's the first battle for this Gunpla,

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:20.470
﻿created with all the know-how of
﻿PPSE's technical development division.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:23.900
﻿I'm hoping for battle results
﻿worthy of the Meijin's title.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.040
﻿There's no need to hope.

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:38.150
﻿For a Meijin, victory is just
﻿the absolute minimum requirement.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.530
﻿I don't care if you're
﻿the works team or not!

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:52.930
﻿So fast!

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:57.870
﻿Take this!

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:15.960
﻿Darn it!

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.430
- ﻿What!?
﻿- What's that!?

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.030
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.040
﻿That was absolutely <i>perfect</i>!

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:42.520
﻿So that's the PPSE works team's...

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.920
﻿...Meijin's real power.

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:48.590
﻿I don't like him.

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:51.730
﻿He thinks he's so special.

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:55.530
﻿His strength is like a monster.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:59.570
﻿He fights as if he only cares
﻿about being the champion.

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:01.700
﻿Reiji, how would you...?

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.640
﻿Hey! Where're you going?

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.810
﻿Mr. Sei! Mr. Reiji!

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.480
﻿No way.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:13.410
I ﻿didn't know he'd inherited
the name of Kawaguchi.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.980
﻿Sei. Reiji.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:19.790
﻿This must be fate, too.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:21.960
﻿Wait up!

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:24.330
﻿Huh. You're...

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:27.930
﻿You're Yuuki, right?

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:31.500
﻿Tell us if you're Tatsuya Yuuki or...

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.940
﻿No!

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:38.370
﻿I'm not Tatsuya Yuuki.

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:42.780
﻿I'm not the former council president
﻿of Seiho Academy High School,

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:45.350
﻿and I was never the captain of
﻿the model-building club.

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:48.650
﻿You know a lot about him, though.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.950
﻿If not, then show us your face!

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:58.660
﻿Alright.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.630
﻿Take a good look...

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.960
﻿at the man who inherited
﻿the Meijin s title.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.670
﻿The face of Kawaguchi!

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:15.540
﻿I-I knew it.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:24.550
﻿He was Yuuki, alright.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:25.390
﻿Yeah.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:28.060
﻿That was definitely Tatsuya Yuuki.

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:33.430
﻿But why is he here?

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.830
﻿He bowed out in the middle.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:39.500
﻿PPSE is this tournament's organizer.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:42.240
﻿He's in this tournament
﻿as their special entry.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.910
﻿He's going to be a tough foe.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:49.040
﻿It's already amazing that...

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:53.150
﻿his Gunpla's made by the PPSE works team,
﻿who know all about Plavsky particles.

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:55.550
﻿On top of that, the fighter is Yuuki.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:06:00.190
﻿And what's more, he's inherited
﻿the title of Meijin Kawaguchi.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:04.360
﻿What's "Kawaguchi" and what's "Meijin"?

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:07.090
﻿The Meijin is...

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:12.200
﻿Meijin Kawaguchi.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:17.870
﻿About half a century ago,
﻿during the first Gunpla boom,

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:21.910
﻿he appeared like a comet as
﻿a legendary plastic model builder.

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:26.880
﻿His superior works were praised
﻿as being made by the hand of God,

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:31.490
﻿and he was so esteemed that
﻿he was called a Meijin or a maestro.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:39.560
﻿The third-generation Meijin Kawaguchi
﻿is a brilliant fighter,

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:45.230
﻿backed up by the PPSE works team
﻿with all their pride.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:50.800
﻿According to information
﻿leaked by the organizer,

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:55.640
﻿tomorrow's second period is
﻿going to be a Battle Royale.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.540
﻿I don't need advance information.

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:01.720
﻿Oh, come on. If it's a Battle Royale,
﻿everyone will be participating.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:05.620
﻿You may fight against
﻿the team Nemesis fighter.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:10.320
﻿Aila Jyrkiainen.

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:13.960
﻿Of course, I don't doubt your victory.

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:19.800
﻿But our CEO, Mr. Mashita, will come
﻿to watch the tournament tomorrow.

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:22.200
﻿I want you to give it your best.

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:25.940
﻿A Meijin's objective is always victory.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.080
﻿That's the spirit.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.980
﻿I'm counting on you, Meijin.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.210
﻿By the way,

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:36.580
﻿why did you show your face
﻿to Sei Iori and his friend?

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:37.750
﻿No idea.

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:40.090
﻿I must've been out of my mind.

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:42.420
﻿Alright. It's okay.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:54.940
﻿It's tiring to act like a Meijin.

00:07:58.270 --> 00:08:03.510
﻿Allan, I wanted to show
﻿Iori and Reiji m determination.

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:10.080
﻿As Meijin, I'll be the champion
﻿of this tournament no matter what.

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:16.660
﻿That was President Yuuki,
﻿just as I thought.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:21.400
<i>﻿Yeah. He denied it, but I'm sure.</i>

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.830
<i>﻿It was so obvious.</i>

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.500
﻿You sound happy.

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:28.570
﻿Huh?

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.270
﻿Yeah.

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:34.540
﻿I may get to fight with Yuuki
﻿on a worldwide stage.

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:40.010
﻿I can find out how good my Gunpla is,

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:42.520
﻿and how far and high it can fly.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.950
﻿I'm so excited.

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:54.700
﻿Someone there?

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.830
﻿I-I'm sorry.

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:59.570
﻿I was out shopping.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.840
Oh, you!

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.240
﻿You're...!

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:06.010
﻿What're you doing here?

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:09.640
﻿You, too! Get out of here.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.110
﻿Only people involved in
﻿the tournament are—

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:15.080
﻿Huh?

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:16.320
﻿Hey, you...

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:18.290
﻿Come here.

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:20.490
﻿- What?
- ﻿Hurry!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.730
- ﻿What's going on?
﻿- Be quiet for a moment.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:30.900
- ﻿What?
﻿- Please!

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.790
﻿That smells so good.

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:54.190
﻿What? What're you saying...?

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.660
﻿Oh, it's this.

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:02.960
﻿What're you doing!?

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:07.530
﻿It's payback for last time.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:08.140
﻿Bye!

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:10.070
﻿W-Wait!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:14.310
﻿Money?

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:18.150
﻿With this much, you could buy
﻿four meat buns.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:24.020
﻿I don't get him.

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:31.930
﻿Thank you for waiting.

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:37.030
﻿We'll now explain the second period
﻿of the World Tournament.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:42.800
﻿In the second period,
﻿we'll use this huge field...

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:47.170
﻿for a Battle Royale with all 90 fighters.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.840
﻿Wow!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:53.150
﻿The battle ends when only
﻿one-third of the machines are left.

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:57.350
﻿Every fighter who survives
﻿will earn four points.

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:00.820
﻿We will now begin the second period.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.360
<i>﻿Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.630
﻿- Star Build Strike!
﻿- Let's go!

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:21.270
﻿All I have to do is to beat up
﻿every opponent I see, right?

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:24.010
﻿Yeah, but they're all strong.

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:25.380
﻿Be careful!

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:27.010
﻿Mr. Sei is right.

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:30.880
﻿It's dangerous to fight alone
﻿in this battle, so...

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.390
<i>﻿How about fighting together?</i>

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:34.890
﻿Yeah, let's!

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.060
﻿Watch out!

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:39.260
﻿Who did that!?

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:41.900
﻿That Gunpla is...!

00:11:42.730 --> 00:11:44.870
﻿The Abigorbine!

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:58.010
﻿It's Luang Dallara,
﻿the Thai champion!

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:04.550
﻿That Gunpla must be the one
﻿that erased the beam.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:09.160
- Let's go!
﻿- Reiji!?

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:10.290
﻿That's reckless!

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:20.000
﻿- Use the shield!
- ﻿Okay!

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:25.570
﻿As I thought, it erased my beam, but...!

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:33.250
﻿He fired missiles at
﻿the same time as the beam!

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:36.580
﻿Mr. Reiji!

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:48.260
﻿With one look, he saw
﻿the weak point of our Absorb Shield!

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:57.470
﻿Too much chasing is a bad idea.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:02.780
﻿He's a tough opponent.

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:05.050
﻿Where are Mr. Sei and Mr. Reiji?

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:40.710
﻿Gotcha!

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.750
﻿Too strong!

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:25.590
﻿The second period is a Battle Royale.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:30.830
﻿I don't have to fight needlessly
﻿and give away my tactics...

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:42.010
﻿Mustn't lower my guard.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:54.890
﻿Let's cooperate for now and
﻿beat one of the top contenders!

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:56.460
﻿Fire, fire, fire!

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.330
﻿I can tell what you're thinking!

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:17.840
﻿How's my smart fighting technique?

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.750
﻿Did you see that, Kirara?

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:20.910
﻿Above you!

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.190
﻿That's a heck of a welcome!

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:31.090
﻿Who did that?

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.030
﻿Th-That's...

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:49.380
﻿A Gaw attack carrier!

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:53.280
﻿I found you, Ricardo Fellini!

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:55.350
﻿Cziommer of Germany.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.220
﻿Wasn't it hard building that?

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:02.390
﻿To beat you, I devoted
﻿all my energy to this.

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:06.260
﻿You...! You...!

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:12.370
﻿I'll avenge myself on you
﻿for stealing my girlfriend last year!

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:16.140
﻿Wait, she came to me!

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:18.040
﻿That's not true!

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:25.050
﻿How is it, Sei?

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:27.050
﻿It's alright, the damage is small.

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:31.450
﻿But we can't use the Absorb Shield now.
﻿One discharge is the limit.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:33.050
﻿- Keep that in mind.
- ﻿Okay!

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:36.490
﻿What's that?

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:39.360
﻿It's a Gaw attack carrier!

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:41.560
﻿Who's it fighting against?

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:47.300
﻿- That Gunpla is...
- ﻿The Wing Gundam Fenice!

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:55.210
﻿I told you, it was her
﻿who came to me!

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:58.210
﻿You should've turned her down!

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:01.820
﻿It's my policy to keep
﻿my door open to everyone!

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:05.050
﻿Don't let him attack, Gengaozo!

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:13.690
﻿Blame this on your own policy.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.800
﻿Let's go, guys!

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:19.700
﻿This is an alliance of those
﻿who share the same scars!

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:22.700
﻿Let's get revenge on him and
﻿go on to the next stage!

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.040
﻿Yeah!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.510
﻿Are you serious!?

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:34.050
﻿Fellini, prepare yourself!

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:44.690
﻿Brother!

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.460
﻿What? Where was that from!?

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:50.130
﻿Darn it!

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:55.470
﻿That Gunpla is...

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:58.370
﻿The Star Build Strike!

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:03.510
﻿What're you doing, Reiji?

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:06.480
﻿If I get beaten, it'll benefit you later.

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:10.380
﻿I don't want you retired here.

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:13.050
﻿I want a one-on-one battle with you!

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:15.720
﻿That's nice to hear!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:41.580
﻿I've been expecting you, Chairman.

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:43.250
﻿Hello!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:47.250
﻿How's the Meijin doing?

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:50.160
﻿He's so strong that
﻿opponents won't go near him.

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:54.260
﻿Being too strong is also a problem.

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:59.730
﻿But this proves PPSE's superiority
﻿in the field of Gunpla technology.

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:01.100
﻿I know, I know.

00:19:01.770 --> 00:19:05.640
﻿I'm happy to have such
﻿excellent employees.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:07.170
﻿Thank you, sir.

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:10.580
﻿What's going on?

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:26.290
﻿Nice and extravagant.

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.660
﻿Gunpla Battle should be like this!

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:39.770
﻿Wh-What the heck...?

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:40.910
﻿Why...?

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:46.980
﻿Why is he in this world!?

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:22.810
﻿It's quick!

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:29.390
﻿I won't let anybody get in our way!

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:44.930
﻿How sad, Fellini.

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:47.870
﻿I'll go ahead and crush you!

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:00.750
﻿Darn!

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:17.870
﻿- The buster rifle...!
- ﻿Don't underestimate my Gaw!

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:23.670
- ﻿Mr. Fellini!
﻿- Darn!

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:46.200
﻿It can't be!!!

00:22:48.370 --> 00:22:49.630
﻿Cziommer!

00:22:56.910 --> 00:22:58.940
﻿I barely made it.

00:22:58.940 --> 00:22:59.910
﻿Mao!

00:23:00.610 --> 00:23:02.510
<i>﻿I owe you for this.</i>

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:05.920
﻿Please be sure to pay me back.

00:23:12.260 --> 00:23:14.820
﻿Wh-Why is the ground shaking?

00:23:34.650 --> 00:23:37.480
﻿Th-That's...

00:23:42.320 --> 00:23:43.750
﻿That Gunpla is...!

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:58.000
﻿What's that huge machine?

00:23:58.000 --> 00:24:00.800
﻿Reiji, we've got
﻿no choice but to use "it".

00:24:00.800 --> 00:24:02.540
Next episode, "Discharge".

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:05.060
A destruction by Gunpla has begun.
